        <li><strong>EF Core + Npgsql + PostgreSQL 16</strong> (<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/ef" rel="noopener">EF Core</a> · <a href="https://www.npgsql.org" rel="noopener">Npgsql</a> · <a href="https://www.postgresql.org" rel="noopener">PostgreSQL</a>)</li>
