        <li><strong>Gitea</strong> (dépôt auto-hébergé, miroir de développement, <a href="https://gitea.io" rel="noopener">gitea.io</a>), <strong>GitHub</strong> (dépôt public, <a href="https://github.com/walbydev/vigie24" rel="noopener">github.com/walbydev/vigie24</a>), <strong>xUnit</strong> (tests, <a href="https://xunit.net" rel="noopener">xunit.net</a>), <strong>Google Fonts</strong> (Inter, Space Grotesk, JetBrains Mono)</li>
